    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Andrew Deftereos of Leonard Wilson Keenan is delighted to present No. 61 St Samson Court to the market. This Fabulous own entrance large apartment is bright and spacious and has been substantially upgraded to a high standard and is in an excellent location. It has a lovely large decked balcony, West facing  to make the most of those long summer evenings. Consisting of 3 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms.\r\n\r\nThis home is located in a sought after development of homes tucked away in a quiet and secluded position yet with every conceivable amenity on your doorstep. It is sure to impress the discerning buyer looking for a fabulous family home or an investor looking for a property where each bedroom has its own bathroom.  . The spaces have been optimised and a lovely upgraded kitchen/ dinner and upgraded flooring throughout. The modern kitchen is fitted with an abundance of base and eye level and full length storage to include all integrated appliances. The apartment also has a separate utility room.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe features of this lovely home include:\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n·         Double glazed windows\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n·         Kitchen UPGRADE\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n·         B3 rated property for green mortgage buyers\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n·         The property has designated parking and beautiful communal grounds.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBaldoyle, Portmarnock & Malahide Villages are all within easy reach. Northern Cross, Clarehall and Donaghmede Shopping Centres are literally on your doorstep. There is an excellent selection of both primary and secondary schools within the immediate area.\r\n\r\nThe area is further serviced by an excellent bus route together with DART Station in Clongriffin making the city most accessible. The M50 / M1 Motorways and Dublin International Airport are also close to hand making this a most strategically positioned address.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n Early viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
      {
